rcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5311.jpg?w=800&amp;ssl=1 800w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5311.jpg?resize=300%2C225&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5311.jpg?resize=768%2C576&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5311.jpg?resize=600%2C450&amp;ssl=1 600w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5311.jpg?resize=400%2C300&amp;ssl=1 400w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5311.jpg?resize=200%2C150&amp;ssl=1 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" data-attachment-id=\"999\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=999\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5312.jpg?fit=800%2C600&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"800,600\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"IMG_5312\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5312.jpg?fit=800%2C600&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"999\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5312.jpg?resize=800%2C600&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-999\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5312.jpg?w=800&amp;ssl=1 800w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5312.jpg?resize=300%2C225&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5312.jpg?resize=768%2C576&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5312.jpg?resize=600%2C450&amp;ssl=1 600w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5312.jpg?resize=400%2C300&amp;ssl=1 400w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5312.jpg?resize=200%2C150&amp;ssl=1 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" data-attachment-id=\"998\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=998\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5315.jpg?fit=800%2C600&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"800,600\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"IMG_5315\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5315.jpg?fit=800%2C600&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"998\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5315.jpg?resize=800%2C600&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-998\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5315.jpg?w=800&amp;ssl=1 800w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5315.jpg?resize=300%2C225&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5315.jpg?resize=768%2C576&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5315.jpg?resize=600%2C450&amp;ssl=1 600w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5315.jpg?resize=400%2C300&amp;ssl=1 400w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5315.jpg?resize=200%2C150&amp;ssl=1 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For each tag, I defined a local 3D coordinate system on the tag plane to get the coordinates in the real world (<code><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#f78da7\" class=\"has-inline-color\">objpoints<\/mark><\/code>). I iterated over all calibration images and uses OpenCV\u2019s ArUco detector, and found the 2D uv pixels (<code><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#f78da7\" class=\"has-inline-color\">imgpoints<\/mark><\/code>) of all the detected ArUco tags.  Images where no markers are detected are skipped. Once the matching <code><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#f78da7\" class=\"has-inline-color\">objpoints <\/mark><\/code><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-primary-color\">and<\/mark><code><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#f78da7\" class=\"has-inline-color\"> imgpoints<\/mark><\/code> are collected, I used <code><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#f78da7\" class=\"has-inline-color\">cv2.calibrateCamera()<\/mark><\/code> to calculate the intrinsics matrix <strong><em>K<\/em><\/strong> and the distortion coefficients <strong><em>d<\/em><\/strong>, calculated as:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>K =<br>\\begin{bmatrix}<br>649.0065172 &amp; 0 &amp; 407.33495294 \\\\<br>0 &amp; 646.83469996 &amp; 290.66436024 \\\\<br>0 &amp; 0 &amp; 1<br>\\end{bmatrix}<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>\\mathbf{d} =<br>\\begin{bmatrix}<br>-0.16860768 &amp;<br>1.00162078 &amp;<br>-0.00521381 &amp;<br>0.006493 &amp;<br>-1.91354924<br>\\end{bmatrix}<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Part 0.2: Capturing a 3D Object Scan<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I 50 took photos of my little friend (who was also in the <a href=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/2025\/09\/02\/becoming-friends-with-your-camera\/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/2025\/09\/02\/becoming-friends-with-your-camera\/\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#0693e3\" class=\"has-inline-color\">dolly zoom project<\/mark><\/a>) with an ArUco tag:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-7 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" data-attachment-id=\"1011\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=1011\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/IMG_5342.jpg?fit=800%2C600&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"800,600\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"IMG_5342\" data-im